 job=new SwingWorker<>(){int completed;String referenceNote="";protected Void doInBackground(){Map<String,EnvironmentControls.Reference> missing=new HashMap<>();for(String url:urls){if(stopping.get()||closed.get())break;HttpRequest request=null;try{request=Core.sessionRequest(HttpRequest.httpRequestFromUrl(url),session,sessionNames);
 if(compare&&!missing.containsKey(roots.get(url))){String root=roots.get(url),issue="기준 요청 실패";EnvironmentControls.Sample first=null,second=null;for(int probeIndex=0;probeIndex<(repeat?2:1);probeIndex++){
  String reference=root+"/wb-missing-"+UUID.randomUUID();var probe=Core.sessionRequest(HttpRequest.httpRequestFromUrl(reference),session,sessionNames);if(!WorkbenchScope.contains(api,probe)){issue="기준 요청 SCOPE 제외";break;}if(stopping.get()||closed.get())break;
  try{var result=api.http().sendRequest(probe,RequestOptions.requestOptions().withResponseTimeout(10000).withRedirectionMode(RedirectionMode.NEVER));var r=result==null?null:result.response();if(r==null){issue="기준 응답 없음";break;}if(r.statusCode()==429){stopping.set(true);referenceNote="기준 HTTP 429 · 후속 요청 중단";break;}
   var sample=EnvironmentControls.sample(r.statusCode(),responseHeaders(r),decodedBody(PacketFormat.decodedResponse(r)),reference,ignored);if(probeIndex==0)first=sample;else second=sample;
  }catch(Exception ex){issue="기준 요청/디코딩 오류";break;}if(probeIndex==0&&repeat)try{Thread.sleep(200);}catch(InterruptedException ex){Thread.currentThread().interrupt();stopping.set(true);break;}
 }missing.put(root,EnvironmentControls.reference(first,second,repeat,issue));}
 if(stopping.get()||closed.get())break;
 if(!WorkbenchScope.contains(api,request)){publish(new Packet(url,preview(request.toString()),"전송하지 않음 · Scope 제외","Scope 제외"));continue;}var rr=api.http().sendRequest(request,RequestOptions.requestOptions().withResponseTimeout(10000).withRedirectionMode(RedirectionMode.NEVER));var response=rr==null?null:rr.response();String headers=response==null?"":responseHeaders(response);String decoded=response==null?"":PacketFormat.decodedResponse(response);String note=response==null?"응답 없음":EnvironmentControls.state(response.statusCode(),headers,decodedBody(decoded),url,missing.get(roots.get(url)),ignored);
publish(new Packet(url,preview((rr!=null&&rr.request()!=null?rr.request():request).toString()),response==null?"응답 없음":preview(response.toString()),note,response==null?"응답 없음":preview(decoded)));if(response!=null&&response.statusCode()==429)stopping.set(true);}catch(Exception e){publish(new Packet(url,request==null?"GET "+url:preview(request.toString()),"요청 실패 · "+e.getClass().getSimpleName(),"전송 오류"));}if(stopping.get()||closed.get())break;try{Thread.sleep(200);}catch(InterruptedException e){Thread.currentThread().interrupt();break;}}return null;}
 protected void process(List<Packet> updates){if(closed.get())return;for(Packet p:updates){if(packets.size()>=300&&!packets.containsKey(p.url))packets.remove(packets.keySet().iterator().next());packets.put(p.url,p);java.util.regex.Matcher code=java.util.regex.Pattern.compile("^HTTP (\\d{3})").matcher(p.state);if(code.find())catalog.feedback(p.url,Integer.parseInt(code.group(1)),p.state);completed++;for(int i=0;i<candidates.size();i++)if(candidates.get(i).url().equals(p.url))paths.setValueAt(p.state,i,3);}showSelected();status.setText("검증 "+completed+" / "+urls.size()+" · "+(stopping.get()?"중지 중":"진행 중"));}
 protected void done(){job=null;if(closed.get())return;start.setEnabled(true);single.setEnabled(true);technologies.setEnabled(true);stop.setEnabled(false);origins.setEnabled(true);prefix.setEnabled(true);limit.setEnabled(true);common.setEnabled(true);repeatMissing.setEnabled(true);volatileFields.setEnabled(true);compareMissing.setEnabled(true);account.setEnabled(true);status.setText((stopping.get()?"검증 중지":"검증 완료")+" · "+completed+" / "+urls.size()+" · 상태 코드는 검토 단서입니다.");if(catalog.sites.containsKey(origins.getSelectedItem()))refresh();status.setText((stopping.get()?"검증 중지":"검증 완료")+" · "+completed+" / "+urls.size()+" · 응답을 반영해 후보 순서 갱신"+(referenceNote.isEmpty()?"":" · "+referenceNote));showSelected();}};job.execute();
